<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Credence System.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Credence System.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Credence Systems Corp to near-term buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Merrill said it kept Credence at long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- On Thursday, Credence posted first quarter earnings of $0.05 a share, compared to earnings of $0.48 a share.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
